{
  "@context": "http://schema.org/",
  "@type": "JobPosting",
  "title": "Host Growth Specialist (Epic Trips)",
  "description": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;At &lt;strong&gt;Worldpackers&lt;/strong&gt;, we believe that &lt;strong&gt;travel can transform people&lt;/strong&gt; - and transformed &lt;strong&gt;people can transform the world&lt;/strong&gt;. ✨&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Since 2014, we’ve been building a global community of conscious travelers and welcoming hosts, enabling meaningful connections and thousands of collaborative experiences around the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Our purpose is rooted in &lt;strong&gt;connection&lt;/strong&gt;. We exist to foster personal growth, cultural exchange, and a more socially and environmentally sustainable world through travel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Respect, inclusion, collaboration, and continuous learning guide everything we do. Being part of Worldpackers — as a traveler, host, or team member — means being part of a diverse, global community where different perspectives are valued and discriminatory behavior has no place.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Being part of Worldpackers means working with purpose - helping more people experience transformative journeys through connection.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re looking for someone who wants to grow with us and help create unforgettable collaborative experiences around the world. 🌎&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Host Growth Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll play a key role in expanding our network of hosts for Epic Trips. You&#39;ll identify, attract, and build relationships with high-potential partners, ensuring that the experiences available on our platform are high-quality, in demand, and built for long-term success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;This role goes beyond growing the number of hosts. You&#39;ll own the acquisition funnel, make data-informed decisions and help build a scalable supply strategy that drives sustainable business growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Prospect and acquire high-potential hosts in strategic markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Evaluate opportunities based on infrastructure, experience quality, capacity, location, and growth potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Own the end-to-end acquisition funnel, from prospecting through host approval.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Improve conversion across outbound, inbound, and referral acquisition channels.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Develop and nurture partnerships that generate new acquisition opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Analyze market trends, identify supply gaps, and contribute to expansion strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Ensure a seamless handoff to the Account Management and Onboarding teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Monitor acquisition performance and continuously optimize the funnel through data-driven insights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who combines analytical thinking with a strong ownership mindset and excellent relationship-building skills. You enjoy solving problems, making decisions based on data, and creating meaningful business impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;You&#39;ll likely be a great fit if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Experience in business development, sales, partnerships, or customer acquisition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Experience managing multiple stakeholders and complex acquisition pipelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Strong analytical skills and the ability to turn data into actionable insights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Excellent communication, organization, and self-management skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Professional proficiency in English to work in a global environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;Nice to have&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Experience in marketplaces, travel tech, tourism, or the sharing economy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Experience using CRM platforms and managing sales pipelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Background in consultative sales or strategic partnerships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;Why join Worldpackers?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;At Worldpackers, you&#39;ll have the autonomy to test ideas, build strategies, and make a direct impact on the growth of one of our most exciting business verticals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;You&#39;ll join a global, purpose-driven team that&#39;s passionate about using technology to connect people through life-changing travel experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
