  "title": "GenAI Intern",
  "description": "&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GenAI Intern&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;We’re looking for a GenAI Intern to help explore and build innovative AI solutions using Microsoft technologies. You’ll work with business teams to identify opportunities, support development of AI prototypes, and gain hands-on experience with tools like Azure OpenAI and Copilot Studio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Support development of GenAI POCs (chatbots, copilots, automations)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Collaborate with teams to understand business needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Assist with prompt design, data integration, and testing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Help monitor performance and gather user feedback&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Currently pursuing a degree in CS, AI, Data Science, or related field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Availability to work on site 4 days a week, part time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Availability to complete a 1 year internship&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Basic Python or programming knowledge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Interest in Generative AI and emerging technologies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Eagerness to learn and experiment in a fast-paced environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Great opportunity to gain real-world AI experience and contribute to impactful projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More lives saved – more life lived!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h5&gt;What’s in it for you:&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;•Attractive compensation package&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;•Recognition awards, company events, university discount options and many more perks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;•Gender Pay Equality&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Autoliv is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. Autoliv does not discriminate in any aspect of employment based on race, color, religion, national origin, ancestry, gender, sexual orientation, gender identify and/or expression, age, disability, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local employment discrimination laws where Autoliv does business.&lt;/p&gt;",
